    {
      "principle": "A partition suit can be filed by a coparcener against other coparceners.",
      "held": "It is held that a partition suit can be filed by a coparcener against other coparceners, as the right to seek partition is available to all coparceners under Section 26 of the Hindu Succession Act, 1956.",
